# Local checkout of OpenIntuneBaseline, source for scripts/import-oib.js.
# Deliberately not committed: the generated templates in IntuneTemplate/ are the result,
# and a second copy of an external repo would only go stale here.
.oib-source/

# Local checkout of IntuneAdmin/IntuneBaselines, source for scripts/import-intuneadmin.js.
# Same reason as .oib-source/: the generated templates are the result.
.intuneadmin-source/

# Deployment copies with filled-in secrets. This repo is public: a storage account key that ends
# up here once stays in it forever, even after a commit that removes it, and is found on GitHub
# by scanners within minutes. Whatever is in local/ never goes along.
/local/
